      ],
      "source": "https://feltonboroughpa.com/about/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Two small streams, Pine Run and Muddy Creek, flow through Felton, adding a gentle waterway charm to the town.",
